{'symbol': 'IP', 'date': '2023-05-12 17:00:00', 'title': 'INTERNATIONAL PAPER RECOMMENDS SHAREHOLDERS REJECT MINI-TENDER OFFER BY TRC CAPITAL INVESTMENT CORPORATION', 'text': 'MEMPHIS, TENN. , MAY 12, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0INTERNATIONAL PAPER\xa0(NYSE: IP) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS RECEIVED NOTICE OF AN UNSOLICITED MINI-TENDER OFFER BY TRC CAPITAL INVESTMENT CORPORATION ("TRC CAPITAL") TO PURCHASE UP TO 3,000,000 SHARES OF INTERNATIONAL PAPER COMPANY ("INTERNATIONAL PAPER") COMMON STOCK FROM INTERNATIONAL PAPER SHAREHOLDERS.'}